      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:rrjvo5jwuateqep2i7ih5ckl/app.bsky.feed.post/3myuio2akg22n",
      "handle": "cfiesler.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Casey Fiesler",
      "text": "Pleased to announce that my silly TikToks about AI are now officially *major award winning* silly TikToks about AI. :) \n\nThanks to @scicommexcellence.nationalacademies.org for this award but also for helping legitimize/incentivize science communication!\n\nwww.nationalacademies.org/news/nationa...",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cfiesler.bsky.social/post/3myuio2akg22n",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-27T14:56:50.143Z",
      "likes": 300,
      "replies": 25,
      "reposts": 37,
      "score": 5.2,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.6,
        "recency": 0,
        "age_hours": 165.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzemhgtjrc2r",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "My own hand-written solution took a few days, and I knew how to solve it because I made the assignment.\n\nWhile it is not impossible for a hot-shot coder who had a lot of NLP and data curating experience could grind through it in 7 hours... I call bullshit. And Pangram says 100% AI.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mzemhgtjrc2r",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-03T00:47:19.070Z",
      "likes": 8,
      "replies": 3,
      "reposts": 0,
      "score": 5.1,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.2,
        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 11.6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzessp6ovc2t",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "Regarding playing, composing, and practicing, which can be individualistic, that hits a different value proposition altogether: creativity and self-expression. \n\nAI generated music personally has not been satisfying to me on either basis. So much so that I chose to learn to play guitar.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mzessp6ovc2t",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-03T02:40:59.389Z",
      "likes": 1,
      "replies": 1,
      "reposts": 0,
      "score": 4,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 0.6,
        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 9.7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzessoz55s2t",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "Sharing of AI generated music may substitute for the social role of music. It would be a very different dynamics. Different doesn't mean worse. I was taking an extreme position.",
